{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"885000","name":"Synth Riders","type":"game","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在 &quot;Synth Riders&quot; 这款节奏动作游戏里随音乐自由舞动。游戏中有官方定制的歌曲和活跃的多人游戏社群，乐趣加倍！ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >推出节日免费歌曲并支持简体中文！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 80+首不同风格的歌曲 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 畅享官方定制歌曲支持</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 探索音乐DLC——来自Dua Lipa、Muse和Lady Gaga等乐队的作品 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 支持10人跨平台游戏</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 在旋转和螺旋（Spin and Spiral）模式下玩转每首乐曲</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 戴上智能健身手表燃烧卡路里</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885000/extras/02910c50e62c5cbdd80b59e5352851ce.poster.avif?t=1778771405\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885000/extras/02910c50e62c5cbdd80b59e5352851ce.webm?t=1778771405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885000/extras/02910c50e62c5cbdd80b59e5352851ce.mp4?t=1778771405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885000/8757926ebcfc60372fddb780a2c89a9ea8156380/header.jpg?t=1778771405","website":"http://synthridersvr.com","developers":["Kluge Interactive"],"publishers":["Kluge Interactive"],"release_date":"2019 年 10 月 31 日","coming_soon":false,"price":{"currency":"EUR","initial":"24.99","final":"24.99","discount":0},"supported_languages":"英语, 法语, 德语, 西班牙语 - 西班牙, 日语, 韩语, 简体中文","platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":["单人","多人","玩家对战","线上玩家对战","跨平台多人","定位控制器支持","VR 独占","应用内购买","Steam 云","包含关卡编辑器","家庭共享"],"genres":["动作","休闲","独立"],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><